hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"182","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamein madad dene wali, khushgawar, ugane wali, faidemand-ghair nuqsandeh, jald-ghair der wali barish de. [Barish ki dua mein padhe]"
"183","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamein barish de, ae Allah! Hamein barish de, ae Allah! Hamein barish de."
"184","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Apne bandon-janwaron ko pila, apni rahmat phaila, apni murda basti zinda kar. [Barish ki dua mein]"
